Subject: [PATCH 1/7] test(ui): add named layout tests for remaining windows
 and modals

Add coarse containment and vertical anchor stacking checks in
crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs for the post refusal
window, unsaved prompt modal, fixture library/vise/plate/accessory
modals, Machines dock pane, and G-code viewer window.

Fixes #1991
